    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "narration": "A coding {{@agent}}agent, Claude Code here, or Codex, Gemini, or Rovo Dev, talks to {{@server}}aidemo’s MCP server. It authors a {{@storyboard}}storyboard: plain JSON, narration and actions. {{@engine}}The engine replays the actions in Chrome, voices the narration locally, and composes an {{@video}}MP4 with ffmpeg. {{@local}}Zero dollars, no API key. {{@replay}}Deterministic replay: no LLM in the loop. {{@json}}A file for any editor, {{@ci}}re-rendered by CI when the product changes.",
