      "id": "prompt",
      "title": "Prompt",
      "narration": "One prompt to Claude Code. The record-demo skill drives aidemo’s MCP server: {{@guide}}it reads the authoring guide, {{@inspect}}inspects the page, {{@write}}writes the storyboard, {{@validate}}validates it, and {{@lint}}lints the pacing. {{@render}}Render is a job: {{@status}}job status reports each stage. {{@skill}}The skill calls the server; the command line is the fallback.",
