    {
      "id": "result",
      "title": "Result",
      "narration": "The result, with its caption track on. Everything in it came from the storyboard: the voice from a model on this machine, after a one-time download; the captions timed from the script; the cuts from ffmpeg. Nothing left this machine, and nobody sat at a screen recorder. When the product changes, rendering again is one command, or one job for the agent, and the committed storyboard is the whole source. The captions are a track, so a viewer can turn them off.",
